 "title": "Compactification",
 "statement": "Let $f\\colon X\\to S$ be a morphism of schemes. A *compactification*\nof $f$ consists of a scheme $\\overline X$, morphisms\n\n$$\nX\\xrightarrow{j}\\overline X\\xrightarrow{p}S,\n$$\n\nand an equality $j;p=f$, such that $j$ is a quasi-compact open immersion and\n$p$ is proper.",
